' SEATS booking state machine (project document Figure 2.3). Render as domain-model.puml.
@startuml
title <b>Booking — state machine</b>

scale 2.3
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam state<<later release>> {
  BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  BorderThickness 1.2
  ArrowColor #334155
  ArrowThickness 1.2
  FontSize 14
  FontStyle bold
  AttributeFontSize 12
  AttributeFontColor #1E293B
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEF9C3
  BorderColor #CA8A04
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam arrowFontSize 11
skinparam arrowFontColor #1E293B

state Held
Held : entry / lock table, start 15-min hold timer
Held : do / show booking details, terms, payment methods

state Confirmed
Confirmed : entry / issue e-ticket (QR), LINE confirmation
Confirmed : do / wait for the check-in window

state CheckedIn
CheckedIn : entry / record checkedInAt and staff

state Expired
Expired : entry / release table, LINE timeout notice

state Cancelled
Cancelled : entry / release table

state NoShow
NoShow : entry / show table as free (resale by hand, no waitlist)
NoShow : table fee forfeited, no refund

state Transferred <<later release>>
Transferred : entry / invalidate original e-ticket

[*] -down-> Held : customer selects a table\n[table has no active Booking for this concert round]

Held -down-> Expired : after (15 min)\n[no payment verified,\nno slip awaiting decision]
Held -down-> Confirmed : payment verified: gateway callback,\nor Manager confirms the transfer slip (UC-01 EF-3)\n[full table fee paid]
Held -down-> Cancelled : customer cancels\n[during hold]
Held --> Held : payment failed or declined\n[hold not expired] / retry

Confirmed -down-> CheckedIn : QR scanned by Front Staff\n[start − 2 h ≤ now ≤ start + 30 min]
Confirmed -down-> NoShow : after (start + 30 min)\n[not checked in]
Confirmed -down-> Transferred : customer transfers booking\n[later release]
Confirmed -up-> Cancelled : Manager cancels\n(exception)
Expired -[norank]-> Confirmed : late payment result (BRULE-17)\n[table still available]

' every terminal state reaches the (shared) final node: the Booking is closed
Transferred -down-> [*]
CheckedIn -down-> [*]
NoShow -down-> [*]
Expired -down-> [*]
Cancelled -down-> [*]

note left of Held
  Business rules: hold = 15 min;
  first lock wins; full payment
  before confirmation.
end note

note bottom of Transferred
  The receiving customer gets a
  <b>new Booking</b> that starts in
  <b>Confirmed</b> with its own e-ticket.
end note

legend bottom left
  Terminal states (CheckedIn, Expired, NoShow, Cancelled, Transferred) end at the final node:
  the Booking is closed and the table is free again (except Transferred, whose table
  passes to the new Booking of the recipient). Expired returns to Confirmed when a
  successful payment result arrives late and the table is still available (BRULE-17).
endlegend
@enduml
